        "content": "## WhatsApp attendance classifier\nwacli posts each group message here. Only the configured group passes the filter. Llama 3.2 3B (Ollama, local) returns one of 9 categories plus confidence, reason, time and leave fields.\n\nThe model does not write to attendance. TeamOffice stays the source of truth.",
