      "id": "10d14f83-fdd7-4362-8beb-87979a794021",
      "name": "Normalise Message"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "=define",
        "text": "=You are an attendance-message classification system.\n\nAnalyze this WhatsApp message:\n\nEmployee: {{ $json.senderName }}\nSender: {{ $json.sender }}\nDate/time: {{ $json.timestamp }}\nGroup: {{ $json.group }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nClassify the message into exactly ONE of these categories:\n\nleave\nhalf_day\nwork_from_home\nlate_arrival\nearly_leaving\nbirthday\ncelebration\ngeneral\nunclear\n\nRules:\n\n- If the employee says they will reach office late or gives a future arrival time, classify as late_arrival.\n- If the employee says they will not attend office for the day, classify as leave.\n- If the employee says they will come/attend in the second half, classify as half_day.\n- If the employee says they are working from home or WFH, classify as work_from_home.\n- If the employee says they are leaving office early, classify as early_leaving.\n- Birthday announcement or birthday wishes = birthday.\n- Office celebration or congratulations = celebration.\n- Normal unrelated conversation = general.\n- Use unclear only when the message genuinely cannot be classified.\n\nImportant:\n\"Reaching office till 11am\" means the employee will arrive at 11am, so classify it as late_arrival.\n\nReturn only a JSON object that matches the output schema. No extra text.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are an attendance-message classification system.  Analyze the WhatsApp message provided by the user.  Classify it into exactly one category: leave half_day work_from_home late_arrival early_leaving birthday celebration general unclear  Rules: - Reaching late or mentioning a future arrival time = late_arrival - Not attending office for the day = leave - Coming or attending in the second half = half_day - WFH or working from home = work_from_home - Leaving office early = early_leaving - Birthday announcement or birthday wishes = birthday - Office celebration or congratulations = celebration - Unrelated conversation = general - If uncertain = unclear  Do not calculate salary deductions. Do not assume leave is approved. Do not invent information."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
